{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are trapped, unable to walk,  with only a desk in front of you. The voice you hear is that of a woman on a speaker. Solve puzzles, interact with your surroundings, and make weighty decisions as you uncover a strange and disturbing story in this supernatural single-player horror mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598450/extras/features_header.png?t=1749894859\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Weighty Choices</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your decisions shape the outcome, leading to different revelations and consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598450/extras/Timeline_4.gif?t=1749894859\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Uncover the mysteries</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A chilling supernatural story unfolds as you dig deeper into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598450/extras/ASOQ_01.gif?t=1749894859\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Trapped and Powerless</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You cannot walk; you only interact with the desk in front of you. Every choice you make matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598450/extras/ASOQ_02.gif?t=1749894859\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Interactive Environment</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Examine objects, uncover hidden details, and manipulate your surroundings to progress.</p><p c